Which way do you see an index which is only used for an autocomplete being used, something like this?

```js
search.addWidgets([
  index({ indexName: 'query_suggestions' })
    .addWidgets([
       autocomplete(), // only widget which reads from this index
    ]),
  hits(),
]);
```

@Haroenv Yes it's solution, depends on the use-case but this should work too:

```js
search.addWidgets([
  index({ indexName: 'query_suggestions' })
  autocomplete(),
]);
```
